9.PARKING - 12 (6′ X 20) VEHICLE STORAGE PARKING STALLS SHALL
BE PROVIDED.SIX AT THE NORTHEAST CORNER AND 6 AT THE
SOUTHWEST. SEVEN (9.5′ X 20^) CUSTOMER WAITING STALLS SHALL
BE PROVIDED AT THE CENTER OF THE PROPERTY FACING RIDGE ROAD.
THESE SEVEN STALLS SHALL NOT BE ALLOWED FOR VEHICLE STORAGE.
VEHICLE STORAGE IS TO BE PERMITTED IN THE BUILDING.A
DIRECTIONAL SIGN SHALL BE FLACED TO DIRECT CUSTOMERS TO THE
CUSTOMER WAITING PARKING AREA.
10.LANDSCAPING - LANDSCAPING SHALL BE PROVIDED BETWEEN THE
PROPERTY LINE AND THE EXISTING SIDE WALK CN THE EAST SIDE OF
PROPERTY. IT SHALL CONSIST OF LANDSCAPE GRAVEL AND SHRUBS
PLACED EVERY TEN FEET.THIS IS TO PROVIDE AS SCREENING FOR
FRONTAGE OF LOT.
11. EASEMENTS - NO EASEMENTS PRESENTLY EXIST. ALL UTILITIES
SHALL COME FROM THE EXISTING PROPERTY TO THE SOUTH.
12. RESTRICTIONS - EXCESSIVE NOISE SHALL NOT BE PERMITTED. TO
ACCOMPLISH THIS INSULATION SHALL BE OF A TYPE TO ELIMINATE AS
MUCH NOISE AS IS PRACTICAL. WASTE MATERIALS (SUCH AS OIL,
ETC.) AND CAR PARTS THAT ARE OF NO VALUE WILL NOT BE
PERMITTED TO BE STORED IN VISIBLE SIGHT AND SHALL BE REMOVED
FROM THE SiTE MONTHLY.
13. BUILDING CONSTRUCTION SHALL BE IN CONFORMANCE WITH LARAMIE
COUNTY STANDARDS AND THE METAL BUILDING MANUFACTURER^S
SPECIFICATION.A COPY OF THE BUILDING MANUFACTURER'S
SPECIFICATIONS SHALL BE SUBMITTED TO THE LARAMIE COUNTY
ENGINEER PRIOR TO CONSTRUCTION.
14.· OWNERSHIP AND MAINTENANCE OF THE DEVELOPED SITE SHALL BE THE
RESPONSIBILITY OF THE OWNERS OF RECORD. SHOULD THE SITE BE
SOLD IT WILL REMAIN AS A VEHICLE REPAIR SHOP.SHOULD A NEW
LAND OWNER DESIRE ANOTHER USE FOR THIS SITE THEY MUST CONSULT
WITH THE CHEYENNE/LARAMIE COUNTY REGIONAL PLANNING OFFICE FOR
APPROPRIATENESS OF NEW USE.SHOULD THE LARAMIE COUNTY ZONING
ENFORCEMENT OFFICER，.DEEM WITH JUST CAUSE THAT THIS SITE IS
NOT IN CONFORMANCE WITH THIS P.U.D., AND AFTER CONSULTING
WITH OWNER OF SITE, THE ZONING OFFICER MAY BE ABLE TO HALT
BUSINESS UNTIL ALL ISSUES ARE RESOLVED TO THE SATISFACTION OF
THE ENFORCEMENT OFFICER AND OWNER.
15.SET BACKS - BUILDING SHALL BE SET BACK FROM NORTH AND WEST
PROPERTY LINES A MINIMUM OF 10 FEET.SET BACKS FROM SOUTH
PROPERTY LINE A MINIMUM OF 67.5 FEET.DUE TO THE POSSIBILITY
OF A PRE-ENGINEERED FOUNDATION ALONG THE WEST PROPERTY LINE,
THE SETBACK FROM THE EAST PROPERTY LINE SHALL BE A MINIMUM OF
75 FEET， BUT SHALL NOT INTERFERE WITH THE PROPOSED VEHICLE
STORAGE PARKING.
